{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_title", "source_sha256": "6c9637097a17ee4185a7faf41be3347659e15c1edf4ecfcf581508bb1a4a367e", "ja": "微笑みの花", "zh": "微笑之花", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4bf58fe344ae2790e9dacf8a9cff8d87c18d2557415d1cb5a06d01f639b0f959", "ja": "これまで劇場のみんなを支えてきた風花が、\n劇場の仲間の力を借りて『正統派アイドル』\nとしてのセンター公演をすることになる。\nファンの人たちの大歓声に包まれ、風花は\n笑顔溢れる公演を成功させるのだった。", "zh": "风花一直以来都在协助剧场的成员，\n这次换她借助伙伴的力量，举办一场\n『正统派偶像』的Center公演。\n在粉丝们盛大的欢呼声下，\n风花成就了让人笑容满溢的公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5bfbb0740a2f10654a08652373def2bd8c45e63363321c96ec6623d79fc9fce3", "ja": "（風花の公演に向けてレッスンが始まった。\n公演メンバーは、千鶴さんと可憐に加えて……）", "zh": "（为了风花公演的练习已经开始了。\n公演的成员除了千鹤和可怜之外，还有……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "d34b435dfecaa242b734846c9ee83ad33b9c90b44e73f00fd9fa1ba23b660f3c", "ja": "というわけで、私たちもメンバーに選ばれました。\n一緒に頑張りましょう。……えいえい、おー。", "zh": "事情就是这样，我们也被选为公演成员了。\n一起加油吧……耶、耶、喔──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "1dc0ab0b903a5cafda8d00d7717122c4e842620b7ba856b9d698db0ee6c948ad", "ja": "風花ちゃん、私じゃ頼りないかもしれないけれど、\nできることがあったら、なんでも言ってね？", "zh": "风花，我或许没那么可靠，\n但要是有什么我帮得上忙的，你就尽管说别客气喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aa14679639a00457f28c918c317506c3e93a9ea49a77d227dc7c14f0b10b2472", "ja": "頼りないどころか、とっても頼もしいです！\nあずささん、瑞希ちゃん、よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "你太谦虚了，梓可是一大战力呢！\n梓、瑞希，请你们多多指教啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "2798572b656fc9860efd2b54e7f4c70ab3a797724e5da78fed9ad04343215a2c", "ja": "わ、私も、ちゃんと役に立てるように……\nしっかり、がんばりますっ。", "zh": "我、我也会、加油……\n努力、帮上忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "c99a172ea1943d634192fff21061494be2ed78052008df3af55a5e37ac155c23", "ja": "わたくし達、皆で力を尽くして、\n風花の公演を成功に導きましょう！", "zh": "我们就一同倾尽全力，\n让风花的公演成功落幕吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9fb24f84efd5be2e65546b335b33cc0da7b7ac564e14adfac01b9d95fa868dd2", "ja": "可憐ちゃん、千鶴ちゃん……。\nううっ、ありがとう～！", "zh": "可怜、千鹤……\n呜呜，谢谢你们～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "58674743f7e29db9e1a20fb0fc3e9051a39f8fc1ac6de8a1b48b90f18198f5e3", "ja": "これで豊川さんの公演に出るメンバーは全員ですね。\n二階堂さんに篠宮さん、そして三浦さん……。", "zh": "这样要参加丰川姊的公演成员就到齐了呢。\n二阶堂姊、筿宫还有三浦姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "1b5d07f8e1083db64d9cf8791d62a462d2b47881549127c63030ea797783ea0b", "ja": "はっ。二階堂さんと……", "zh": "啊，二阶堂姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "d6828bd74aaff2973e26a67c6512c14d363842b142db011c11d30edbe7905f2b", "ja": "篠宮さんと……", "zh": "跟筿宫……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "692cda506545243b7263f83e026df04b95981dea00a0367a84bd30c9920c8334", "ja": "三浦さん……", "zh": "和三浦姊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "85c3c4f0c83157f694e860b19736b4ebd45bd1fdf87b328e5278b8f4a36ed3f0", "ja": "そして私が、豊川さんの公演に……！", "zh": "还有我……要参加丰川姊的公演……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b5d5d555fc270fd2cff9e18dd6d0c581a7b1d5b237c0df9280a13969c7b73f9e", "ja": "み……瑞希ちゃん、どうしたの？", "zh": "瑞……瑞希，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "b19b7216bb4d45d2ee36bbdb4de5d7dc91b24e9464e7be7f28e70ad42f441d59", "ja": "{$P$}、このメンバー構成はつまり…\n私の将来性が認められた、ということでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}，你安排这个名单的意思是……\n认可了我将来的发展潜力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1014_p", "source_sha256": "13c30b8c1a9e905f404c37d84035d40c517afa37b6ff35818473f01a34628697", "ja": "ん？　瑞希の将来性……？", "zh": "嗯？瑞希将来的发展潜力……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6b3ee8e18d9611eff3364c4929163677e52369927409cbae3b548ee1db8051e5", "ja": "ああっ、もしかしてスタイルのこと！？", "zh": "啊啊！你指的难道是身材！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7a14ea0fb3664ec6be043f74d600fa95cd61f96df26f77b634c9b8a36e7610e5", "ja": "うう、{$P$}さん……。公演の\n本当のテーマは、やっぱりセクシーなんですか～？", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}先生……\n公演真正的主题，果然还是性感吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "0c2c001d6d3d13473085a9b907455ef53c1c4fa161b3fc6ee27f0907437e234d", "ja": "え、ええっ！？", "zh": "咦、咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "02e9055e007507866690b9dd784525caba0cfaa27a35dab19c805796f034efbc", "ja": "ま、まあ？", "zh": "这、这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "8da82d2eb1168a6da456195163b39e48eea679944a80a3cd4c9ce543a51e207f", "ja": "あ、あらあら～。", "zh": "哎、哎呀哎呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "3efbbcb8b20d3fe60758d85098f46329eef7b58538aad2fe2c9f18a0c27d7dc7", "ja": "……ぽっ。", "zh": "……（脸红）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1021_p", "source_sha256": "5f0a118c0ae9279ebd2dcfe7c50dffd0a7de64c17026cb5044f3fc2a9cdbb93e", "ja": "ち、違うって！　このメンバーを選んだのは、\nスタイルとかプロポーションとかじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不、不是啦！这个成员名单，\n我看的并不是身材和比例……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c68853220af963431494bba609b3e103b6a1d8bfe7d3cd341b5cbb4eced24a81", "ja": "風花の優しい雰囲気とか、\n個性の組合せとかを考えた結果だよ。", "zh": "是我基于风花的温柔氛围，\n以及个性上的组合来安排的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4b20eb1f958f0adbefd630ceba89a86cfffa4a3738a0a0535a0b047a433e3004", "ja": "え……そ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦……是、是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1024_p", "source_sha256": "5935109f572c99f94a90a77de624a24c5b7a194e9645b547ab4e4b157dbdd774", "ja": "ああ。テーマは前に言った、正統派アイドルらしい\nみんなを笑顔にする公演で間違いない。安心してくれ。", "zh": "是啊，主题就如先前说的，是以正统派偶像之姿，\n办一场人人都能欢笑的公演没错，你放心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1025_044miz", "source_sha256": "90d60aeb25a1cf646b40c3230f7172115d6ccd59d3e3f8769e822034c361ac90", "ja": "なんと、私の勘違いでしたか。\nそれは少し残念です。……個人的に。", "zh": "哎呀，原来是我误会了。\n有点小可惜……就我个人而言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "bd38f8790f4ef0609ca0d7309dbd4a3c1200c8874f7f41d1399bd89f867c5156", "ja": "豊川さん、お騒がせしてすみませんでした。\n瑞希、反省。……しゅん。", "zh": "丰川姊，对不起吓到你了。\n瑞希会反省的……（失落）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9e18296e96b8f3de0a2efa892febaff0a2caa8f402825db3de637bb0bf74c3d7", "ja": "う、ううん、気にしないで！　瑞希ちゃんが間違える\nのも無理ないよ。私もてっきり、そうだと思ったから。", "zh": "没、没事的，别在意！瑞希会误会也是正常的，\n毕竟连我自己都认为是那样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1028_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cfd06ce706db02c2ff6289dda3222e5e296c29ead639352f9e074a0d66fe305c", "ja": "でも……。\n優しい雰囲気、だなんて……♪", "zh": "不过……\n居然说我给人感觉很温柔……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1029_010azu", "source_sha256": "023b8770a8895e234b77fc606ea983b690312c604f9e4fba9e931c2d646a3854", "ja": "みんなを笑顔にする公演……。\nふふっ、とっても素敵ですね♪", "zh": "让人人都能欢笑的公演……\n呵呵，听起来真是美好♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1030_010azu", "source_sha256": "dbdeb9d28ba7cb63fc09026f0213155ce5c42febabaccf09289b6a683e88b58e", "ja": "そうだ！　みんな、自分のセンター公演のことは、\nどう思ってるのかしら？", "zh": "对了！大家对自己的Center公演\n都是怎么想的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1031_010azu", "source_sha256": "82bcce785f8f207fbf091002d380582a6feb181fb6a2450c8e272f289c5501b6", "ja": "どんな準備をして、どんなことを思ったか。話してもら\nえたら、風花ちゃんの参考になるかもしれないわね♪", "zh": "做了哪些准备、有过怎样的想法，\n每个人都分享一下的话，或许能让风花参考呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1032_p", "source_sha256": "f6fdd833db629c7328bc2a256825a81478772ccef85c382a91375a40f137267d", "ja": "なるほど、いいですね。俺も聞いてみたいし……\n風花も聞きたいんじゃないか？", "zh": "说的也是，这点子真不错，我自己也挺好奇的……\n风花应该也会想听吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a7a164ff5be2063067b0d44483edcfa64674259019a556a190d214f1b4e9674d", "ja": "はい、よかったら、ぜひ！\nあずささん、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "是，如果可以的话，就麻烦大家分享了！\n梓，谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "d27fa560543dab3ec1b228352cb6a2977bcef0d5eb5f0e06064b104c58d82b3a", "ja": "では、まずは私の話をしましょう……。コホン。\n私はセンターの座をかけて、死闘を繰り広げました。", "zh": "那么，就由我先说吧……咳咳，\n我为了争夺Center的宝座，展开了一场生死斗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1035_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e78f97382440f0b202be93846fee7c727a5df5f7f3a1b93be62f0115020648be", "ja": "え、死闘！？", "zh": "生、生死斗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "5113b89a3a2f47d57a96b1e9b4a993f15d06f724440a79de8ca55c9307df1429", "ja": "すみません、話を盛りました。でも、ジュリアさんと\nセンターの座をかけて戦ったのは本当です。", "zh": "对不起，我太浮夸了。不过，我确实为了\nCenter这个位置和茱莉亚对立过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "e9d531dac1d101eb0800e0c70abe8593806e0be271b5c9e9e41cf7d71f470352", "ja": "ですが、そのおかげで、私はジュリアさん、そして\nみなさんとの絆が、とても深まったと思います。", "zh": "但是，正因为有这段经验，我觉得自己\n和茱莉亚以及各位的关系更加深了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "10705939cbcbf81e7eba5ddea0fe90d46dd045026a512b07e5080d26f2153a9f", "ja": "あの時のことを思い出すと、今でも胸が熱くなります。\nかけがえのない、大切な経験でしゅ……っ。", "zh": "即便是现在，想起当时的事仍会让我热血沸腾。\n对我而言，那真的是一段无可取代的宝贵锦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "7b34acde52d33a81ab3e185db733c9bd4f50e1a23d3336ec15491fde1897dd48", "ja": "……すみません、唐突に噛みました。\nまだまだ、修行が足りません……。", "zh": "……对不起，突然咬到舌头了。\n看来我的修行还不到家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4ef0ed5c56adad129e515065f36f6aa2070d0c6a0358244e48cb4b896cd7f497", "ja": "だ、大丈夫だよ瑞希ちゃん。\nお話は全部、ちゃんと聞けたから！", "zh": "别、别在意啦，瑞希。\n你想说的，我都听清楚了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1041_038chz", "source_sha256": "cf7d1ef20393d0809537cc34cf82af04fb91cd6342bbf4d998edfc8ac0a5109f", "ja": "そうですわね、わたくしは……センター公演で、\nセレブとしての真の務めを学んだように思いますわ。", "zh": "这个嘛，本小姐……觉得自己在Center公演中，\n明白了身为名流真正的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3e85a68257eea9f1ab8b99eeb19c24b3d182f6b5a1980df3929eb6e18f7aa5d7", "ja": "セレブとして……！", "zh": "身为名流……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1043_038chz", "source_sha256": "7b1652439c75ebcaf81873fc5b9df89ca972ca018c8a2333bd71b0979009d1ed", "ja": "はっ。す、少し大げさでしたわね……コホン。\nつまり、アイドルとしての心構えのようなものです。", "zh": "啊，本、本小姐说得有些夸张了……咳咳。\n换言之，这跟偶像该有的心态是类似的概念。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1044_038chz", "source_sha256": "6f53c63a836bfbfdbd7d92504254e88c623dc4d819d008ee4a93dca1c30fde25", "ja": "なぜ、誰のために輝くのか。……気づかせてくれたのは\n他でもない風花と、大切な仲間達ですけれど。", "zh": "出于什么原因，又是为了谁想上台发光发热……让本小姐\n明白这点的不是别人，就是风花和重要的伙伴们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1045_045kar", "source_sha256": "50f33a51a0ff2dfcd268cefeb8528c4f980ae65a6795a40dfa640fe4611c63d5", "ja": "わ、私は、千鶴さんみたいに、輝くとか、\nそこまでは考えられませんでしたけど……。", "zh": "我、我是没有想过\n要像千鹤姊那样，闪闪发光……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1046_045kar", "source_sha256": "528ae653e696656466ebaa44b050cf443cb213f50d5355d1b418b4e59768b050", "ja": "い、一時はもう、私にセンターなんて無理だって……\n思っちゃうくらい、緊張して……。で、でも……。", "zh": "甚、甚至还曾经、紧张到……认为自己\n是不可能、担当Center的……可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1047_045kar", "source_sha256": "35417de7d088161d224c839a504ba385476b338d807405c03cc05ecd7d95bfd9", "ja": "じ、自分ができる精いっぱいで最後までがんばろうって\n……そ、そう思える勇気をくれたのは、やっぱり……。", "zh": "我、我还是想尽力拚到最后一刻……\n自、自己之所以会有这样的勇气，果然还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1048_045kar", "source_sha256": "ed7ce233db76a2b2f377cd300c9ed9b440f34947d45a4bc4e48ab728c9385f8e", "ja": "風花さんと、劇場のみんな……\nそれから、{$P$}さん、です……♪", "zh": "因为有风花姊，跟剧场的大家……\n还有，{$P$}先生的缘故……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1049_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ee94199fd9ff4d776174c56d69c70d78011323a03c2ec1ad688d7d193398906c", "ja": "千鶴ちゃんも、可憐ちゃんも……。\nそんな風に思ってくれてたんだ。", "zh": "原来千鹤和可怜……\n都是这么想的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1050_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1ec5102e2677fdddd061fdb15f21619f8e4a543487362b1939bd4ca58454b229", "ja": "うん、すごく参考に……励みになりました！\nやっぱりみんな、ちゃんと考えてるんだよね。", "zh": "嗯，大家的分享都非常有参考价值……\n也给了我很大的鼓励！大家果然都有认真思考过呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1051_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4f832be6a5c12f8d11cf79a8a56c8c575f717550cf1db4c799ef91f3305aad6c", "ja": "私も、センターとして……。\nみんなの期待に応えられるよう、がんばりますっ！", "zh": "我也要以Center的身分……\n努力加油来回应大家的期待！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1052_010azu", "source_sha256": "65fdc013b2b220cb0bd07d336b8e44a4a687cae67fb2bae2da3f8c1b7008b280", "ja": "あらあら、風花ちゃんたら。\nちょっと張り切りすぎじゃないかしら。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，风花真是的。\n你这样是不是有点太拚了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1053_010azu", "source_sha256": "1655942829d581f48e732bdf8fa339572ec167151ddf8e04f88321d3a44382af", "ja": "そんなに無理しなくても大丈夫、\nきっと素敵な公演になるって思うわよ。", "zh": "用不着这么勉强自己，\n我相信公演一定会很棒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1054_010azu", "source_sha256": "f5ca6798bc4d605ca22af75fe0527bf36abd78b22478ca8c91168860a5a927ab", "ja": "だって、私たちも、ファンのみんなも。\n風花ちゃんのことが大好きなんだもの。うふふっ♪", "zh": "因为我们，还有粉丝们，\n都最喜欢风花了，唔呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
