{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1056_p", "source_sha256": "84539f665cf4fc7443a2095178a08d5d379166a4eacc73ec3b98c58f4497f9c5", "ja": "そう、みんなで力を合わせて、いい公演にしような。\nというわけで……。", "zh": "没错，大家一起合力打造一场动人的公演吧。\n所以呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
