{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1067_p", "source_sha256": "1a9c8b5c14bc48ce783eca6eaad8a49cd4b777c127010baa5b65f27013283a23", "ja": "……お疲れさま、風花。やっぱりひとりで残って、\n練習してたのか。少し休憩したらどうだ？", "zh": "……辛苦了，风花。你果然还留在\n这里练习啊，稍微歇一会儿如何呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
