{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1069_p", "source_sha256": "95870a35356c856edcfd24779ef44ad293effe97d9161ac6f965207a776e5bc0", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど、まだ先は長いんだから。\nほら、差し入れも持ってきたぞ。", "zh": "我明白你的心情，但后面还有好长一段路要走呢。\n来，我还有带慰劳品喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1070_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ddd0f90e8ad8b35b6e22c366c6a3917609b00a727910053446cf05e7b48d77ff", "ja": "わぁ……ありがとうございます。\nじゃあ、ちょっとだけ……。", "zh": "哇……谢谢你。\n那就先休息一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1071_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9bcece0eaf448249eb69a1ff4001000699da008c5d8342670fe4edcb9c098cf8", "ja": "はぁ～、美味しいです……。\n冷たいドリンクが、体に染みこんでいくみたい♪", "zh": "呼～真好喝……\n冰凉的饮料让人觉得通体舒畅呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1072_p", "source_sha256": "e80447f2f18ff66c1158826e674f9f35b0079b2ff65ebc7116ea89822efaff16", "ja": "それだけ体が疲れてるんだよ。\n今日はもう上ったらどうだ？", "zh": "这就代表你的身体有多疲劳喔。\n今天就先练到这边怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1073_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a146665385db6b46c079e81490c849ecc64c0a046ec36bcaa24f17a350d43053", "ja": "そうですね……。でも、ごめんなさい、\nもうちょっとだけ。", "zh": "说得也是……不过，对不起，\n我还是想再练一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1074_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1a7cf20f0bb856e6ae3e86effff0ae430fe1b94a7cf3ef6fe6005b4cd836a62e", "ja": "あ、違うんですよ？　私ひとりでがんばらなきゃ、とか\nそんな風に思ってるわけじゃないんです。", "zh": "啊，你可别误会哦，我并不是觉得\n只能靠自己一个人努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1075_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ff8b91eb0b7b759f722c288155a2aa55de44503174b9da78d70e3eb2bae3c49b", "ja": "みんなが、みんなでいい公演にしようって言ってくれて\n……とっても嬉しかったし、わかってるつもりです。", "zh": "大家说要一起打造一场美好的公演……\n这件事真的让我很开心，我也明白大家是认真的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1076_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bce1c2367ddc3e9d0837bd6bcdf20e6edcb12dfd34e03bca9a71f84f0a3b6511", "ja": "でも、嬉しかったからこそ……今、すごくがんばりたく\nて。……って、やっぱりダメですか？", "zh": "可是，正因为这份开心……让我想从现在\n就开始加紧练习……我这样想果然不妥吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1077_p", "source_sha256": "4d901c03242a47054711f9f3f09d06545fd02c6c68fbb316c143034df574c599", "ja": "いや、わかった上でならいいと思うよ。\n風花なら、無茶なこともしないだろうし。", "zh": "没这回事，既然你明白那就没关系。\n我相信风花是不会乱来，搞坏身体的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1078_p", "source_sha256": "b810eeee8c1b6629d2d694062a3477ad9d5e755f40f77502b11efcf15320b15d", "ja": "それじゃ、俺も今日の仕事は目途がついたから、\n最後まで付き合おうかな。", "zh": "那么，我今天的工作也告一段落了，\n就陪你练到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1079_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1080_041fuk", "source_sha256": "99f75eed4ee74193d934493a5d88f39d99f66145d4aecdd73290956e3f1488cb", "ja": "あ、あの……聞いても、いいですか？", "zh": "那、那个……我可以问你一个问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1081_p", "source_sha256": "9a85a69eb4b1dcce9e9d996f6f48877eb33dec24e7ccbff04616d214b7475158", "ja": "うん？　どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1082_041fuk", "source_sha256": "24871b4f888b52262235e3a2020dbebd639583514061fe488b34b6cf1b04d012", "ja": "どうして今回は、その……\n正統派でいいって、言ってくれたんですか？", "zh": "为什么这次，呃……\n你会同意我走正统派路线呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1083_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c054ce7a1cfbd515889c9c723dc1526c23cd80453822918325e76a68df8102ee", "ja": "だって今までは、あんなに……\nセクシーなお仕事ばっかりだったのに……？", "zh": "之前你帮我找的工作……\n明明就都是要求性感的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1084_p", "source_sha256": "3da9f04f42fa53a6b246d9440855ce77ba7a3f5c42ab96347a21f1b8310a8889", "ja": "ば、ばっかりは言いすぎじゃないか？", "zh": "说、说「都是」也太夸张了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1086_p", "source_sha256": "b0cb5b73a21355c744667cd5c4a3bfe607d201297b2a7ed48e8ca4727a398b0b", "ja": "そ、そうか、まあいい。\nでも、そうだな。今回は正統派でいい、というか……", "zh": "这、这样啊，算了。\n不过，这个嘛，与其说是同意正统派，不如说是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_1087", "source_sha256": "4e72ec23b787d5873bd7ebb8974c3a4bad6db86ed448adb069a2385966e7dd20", "ja": "風花に似合うから", "zh": "因为适合风花", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a3bd9a2953818752c26e26ae2e20fdae4e2adfbb2c3d0913bce9d7f17b74410d", "ja": "単に一番、風花に似合うから、かな。", "zh": "单纯是因为这样最适合风花吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "35f3b15ac62261a3bed592c8296952a8531d16e82939970f212e459532facdb3", "ja": "えっ。私に……正統派が？", "zh": "咦？我适合……走正统派？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2002_p", "source_sha256": "bd240e55810d338973b6060db1bd33f90d0574c3dab3697669104418cf62379f", "ja": "みんなを笑顔にするために、周りに手を差し伸べて、\n笑いかけたり、支えたり、励ましたり……。", "zh": "为了让大家露出笑容，向周围伸出援手、\n给予微笑、支持和鼓励……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2003_p", "source_sha256": "000e6be9edd3da6e04decaa9fed6bf6df255fd39970f9756aca650fe33841be6", "ja": "そうやって風花は、今まで仲間を支えてきてくれた。\nだから今度は風花の番だ。", "zh": "风花一直以来都是像这样在帮助伙伴的。\n所以这次，轮到你当主角了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c8917059597186edf34f95ccce2491449dcdcfd6e4eeb8e403df6fd12e95650a", "ja": "センターとして仲間と一緒に、ファンのみんなを笑顔に\nしてあげてくれ。アイドル風花の公演でな！", "zh": "作为Center和伙伴们一起用偶像风花的公演，\n让台下的粉丝笑开怀吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "74482a344aa9d37c67f87bafd60ffd35c1aef173c4949d88b97f8485daa0f7b6", "ja": "アイドルの私……。アイドル……！", "zh": "身为偶像的自己……我是偶像……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0d12b7ad285cd95f94b385ae4abed383f34508a91c0b7e1a15bb9560e56c8587", "ja": "はい……、はいっ！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。", "zh": "好的……好的！\n非常感谢你，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6a109fb737db6404e042fc824bf943f71c93cd2696d052bfec62fb0e49ed4329", "ja": "私、まだまだですけど……でもアイドルとして、しっか\nりがんばりますね。劇場のみんなと力を合わせて……。", "zh": "我虽然还不足以独当一面……但我会努力\n尽到偶像的本分，和剧场的大家齐心协力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f2acf40eef5041e974102d4a0fc51c7b78b5b6b1f5e3534f7224051ddbe05560", "ja": "ファンのみんなが、明日が楽しみになるくらい元気に\nなれるように……。そんなアイドルになれるように！", "zh": "为了带给粉丝们足以期待明天的活力……\n为了成为这样的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2009_p", "source_sha256": "41c72aadf9673fd2a95e5d64ac9c5bac96ae6a08ba96084c112214d42bc73766", "ja": "（……1日の終わりに、明日を思って笑顔を\n浮かべられる。そんな風花ならできるだろう）", "zh": "（……能在一天的尾声中，光想到明天就露出笑容。\n我想这样的风花肯定没问题的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_042_2010_p", "source_sha256": "4cfedf4f99524073bf84ef4da2e209dc0b0504b507aa073c6570670e714bbe24", "ja": "（その優しくて明るい気持ちを、ファンのみんなに\n届けてもらおう。この劇場から、みんなと一緒に！）", "zh": "（我要帮助她将温柔又明亮的心情传达给粉丝们。\n就从这个剧场，与大家一起！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
